                                                "sense_id": "9320caef-2d1d-3cac-960a-9f1e61306ae2",
                                                "text": "An antisuicide pact, too, seems at first glance to be collaborative: the therapist conducts therapy under the terms of an agreement made with a patient[…]"
                                            },
