                                                "sense_id": "9320caef-2d1d-3cac-960a-9f1e61306ae2",
                                                "text": "Although not definitively demonstrated by direct placebo-controlled data, there is mounting evidence from a variety of research methodologies supporting the antisuicide effect of lithium."
